## Title: |cFF69B4PB's Weave & Block Trainer|r 1.4.0
## Author: |cFF69B4PinkBanther|r
## Description: A timing aid for weaving and block cancelling. A bar counts the 1-second skill cycle and lights up (with an optional tick) when it is time to light attack and then cast. Right after a skill it flashes the moment to block-cancel, and when light attack, skill and block all connect it says EXCELLENT! with the times. It only shows timing -- every attack, skill and block is still your own button press.
## Version: 1.4.0
## APIVersion: 101050 101051
## OptionalDependsOn: LibHarvensAddonSettings>=20106
## SavedVariables: PBsWeaveBlockTrainer_Data

lang/strings.lua
lang/$(language).lua

Main.lua
Settings.lua

